Regulatory & Red Flag Targets: Search for Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) and Department of Justice (DOJ) enforcement actions, including accounting fraud, insider trading, and Foreign Corrupt Practices Act (FCPA) bribery charges, alongside FinCEN penalties, OFAC sanctions violations, UK Bribery Act enforcement, and World Bank debarments. Review U.S. Customs and Border Protection (CBP) Withhold Release Orders, Uyghur Forced Labor Prevention Act (UFLPA) enforcement, Dodd-Frank conflict minerals violations, and findings by the ILO, Amnesty International, or Human Rights Watch. Investigate whistleblower retaliation suits, NDA abuse, leak databases (e.g., ICIJ Panama Papers), municipal tax subsidy clawbacks, contentious zoning or eminent domain disputes, indigenous sovereignty violations, and environmental justice citations.